%% RAG pipeline implemented by architecture/rag_explainer.
flowchart TB
    A[PHQ-8 knowledge base CSV<br/>shared/phq8_knowledge_base.csv]:::data
    B[Parse symptom rows<br/>rag_retriever._load_csv]:::process
    C[Build embedded chunks<br/>definition, patterns, severity signals]:::process
    D[SentenceTransformer<br/>all-MiniLM-L6-v2]:::model
    E[FAISS IndexFlatL2<br/>in-memory vector index]:::data

    Q[Input text sample]:::interface
    P[predict_proba<br/>and classify_severity]:::tool
    QE[Embed query]:::process
    K[Similarity retrieval<br/>top_k = 3 in MCP server]:::process
    RD[RetrievedDoc list<br/>symptom themes and distances]:::data
    RG[RAGResult raw result]:::data
    GG[generate_rag_explanation<br/>client-side final generator]:::generator
    L[Gemini final wording]:::llm
    O[RAG explanation]:::output

    A --> B --> C --> D --> E
    Q --> P --> RG
    Q --> QE --> K
    E --> K --> RD --> RG
    RG --> GG --> L --> O

